      "statement": "McpBearerAuthenticationFilter.doFilterInternal() delegates to OpenProjectTokenValidator.validateCurrentRequestOrThrow(), creates a UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken with ROLE_MCP_USER, persists the context via RequestAttributeSecurityContextRepository, and returns 401 on UnauthorizedException.",
